---
/*
 * Two-line homepage teaser. The full data-protection detail — sub-processors,
 * retention, DPA, the security FAQ — lives on /security.
 */
---

<section class="border-b border-line bg-paper-shade text-ink">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-6 py-[var(--section-y)]">
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 items-end gap-[clamp(2.5rem,1.5rem+3vw,5rem)] lg:grid-cols-2">
      <div>
        <p class="font-mono text-xs tracking-[0.02em] text-cobalt-ink">// security</p>
        <h2
          data-reveal
          class="serif-heading mt-5 max-w-[22ch] text-[length:var(--text-h2)] text-ink"
        >
          Built for GDPR procurement, not around it
        </h2>
      </div>
      <p class="max-w-[50ch] text-[length:var(--text-lead)] leading-relaxed text-muted">
        Plans are stored in Frankfurt on EU infrastructure. The record holds a student's name and
        email and nothing else about them. Every sub-processor is listed by name, and a Data
        Processing Agreement is available on request.
      </p>
    </div>
    <a
      href="/security"
      data-track="link-security"
      class="group mt-7 inline-flex min-h-11 items-center gap-2 text-[0.95rem] font-semibold text-cobalt-ink underline decoration-cobalt-ink/35 underline-offset-[5px] transition-colors hover:text-cobalt-bright"
    >
      Read the security and data protection page
      <span aria-hidden="true" class="transition-transform group-hover:translate-x-0.5">→</span>
    </a>
  </div>
</section>
